Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:03:42 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Live breadcrumb clock, 12h/24h setting, logo link, theme
 switcher

The Overview and Settings breadcrumbs show the device's current date and
time (clock.js), in a 12h/24h format set under Settings -> Dashboard.
The sidebar logo links to Overview, and the user dropdown gets the
dark/light theme switcher back, switching in place without a reload.

